  "description": "Who wants to reach the stars?\n\nEveryone is welcome to join and help build up a new shining guild on the horizon.\n\n........................\n\nRaid Times: \n- Mon-Fri, 13:37 CEST\n- Mon, Wed, Fri: higher raids (currently Enchanted Oasis or Floating Gardens of Aetheria)\n- (Tue), Thu: lower level raids for new members depending on the least active guild member&#039;s combat level (currently Crystal Caverns)\n\nAssaults:\n- currently ~1x/week around raid or instead of raid (time not fixed yet and subject to change depending on your feedback!)\n\nEnergizing Pool Buff (subject to change)\n- Tue, 11:00 CEST (before assault)\n- Sat, 22:00 CEST \n- Sun, 22:00 CEST\n\n\n‐--------------------\n\nThis week&#039;s guild activities:\n\n- Mon (13:37 CEST): Raid at Floating Gardens of Aetheria (requiring combat level 70)\n\n- Tue (13:37 CEST - 17:37 CEST): Assault at Whispering Woods \n\n- Wed (13:37 CEST): Raid at Enchanted Oasis (requiring combat level 60)\n\n- Thu (13:37 CEST): Raid at Crystal Caverns (requiring combat level 25)\n\n- Fri (13:37 CEST): Raid at Floating Gardens of Aetheria (requiring combat level 70)\n\n.......................................\n\nNext Guild Hall component:\n\n&quot;Empty Slot&quot;:\n\n- 3,305/ 7,500 Mahogany Log\n- 221 / 10,000 Mystical Log\n- 9,437 / 10,000 Chromite Bar\n- 1,484 / 7,500 Mystic Bar\n\n.................\n\nGuild Hall Repairs:\n\nEach guild hall component decays over 80 days and needs to be repaired regularly.\n\nIn the following, you can find the repair costs of our active components as well as the last Date it was repaired. \nIt would be great, if we could always have a stock of materials available to repair them.\n\nConquest Banner (May, 16th):\n- 5,000 Yew Log\n- 3,750 Maple Log\n- 6,250 Mystical Log\n- 5,000 Copper Bar\n- 5,000 Steel Bar\n- 5,000 Uranium Bar\n- 3,750 Mystic Bar\n\nEnergizing Pool (May, 8th):\n- 12,500 Spruce Log\n- 12,500 Maple Log\n- 7,500 Mystical Log\n- 7,500 Iron Bar\n- 7,500 Mercury Bar\n- 7,500 Uranium Bar\n\nArmory (Apr, 25th):\n- 5,000 Birch Log\n- 5,000 Willow Log\n- 6,250 Mystical Log\n- 5,000 Copper Bar\n- 5,000 Mercury Bar\n- 5,000 Uranium Bar\n- 3,750 Mystic Bar",
